(1744063, 236876, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ya, this is damn cool...or hot.  Wait, the fire is out of focus.  Naw, I have to give it a 10...even though I''ve tasted pepper vodka and don''t like it a bit.</td>', 'Ya, this is damn cool...or hot.  Wait, the fire is out of focus.  Naw, I have to give it a 10...even though I''ve tasted pepper vodka and don''t like it a bit.', '2005-09-28 01:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
