(1744859, 236562, 27482, '<td valign="top">It´s a darn shame as I really like this shot and if the challenge had been architecture or something like that (did you by any chance mean to submit this for "from the ground up"?) I would have given this an 8 but as it is it´s wildly off topic and that is the single most important factor in a shot for me personally, I gave it a 3.  Love how the reflection works in the shot.</td>', 'It´s a darn shame as I really like this shot and if the challenge had been architecture or something like that (did you by any chance mean to submit this for "from the ground up"?) I would have given this an 8 but as it is it´s wildly off topic and that is the single most important factor in a shot for me personally, I gave it a 3.  Love how the reflection works in the shot.', '2005-09-28 10:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744861, 237075, 43822, '<td valign="top">Very Nice...I Think That The Toothpick Shoud Have Been Closer To The Center Of the Glass,So As To See It Better...But Overall Very Nice!!</td>', 'Very Nice...I Think That The Toothpick Shoud Have Been Closer To The Center Of the Glass,So As To See It Better...But Overall Very Nice!!', '2005-09-28 10:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
