(1744943, 235970, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool effect with the motion blur on the backround, works nicely BUT I wounldn´t buy this beer if this was a shot in a commercial.  That´s not from a photographic viewpoint since this image is technically well done but the beer looks unflattering and stale, if the glass had been full with beer and with foam at the top and maybe a little moisture on the outside of the glass I would definately buy this product.  6 from me.</td>', 'Cool effect with the motion blur on the backround, works nicely BUT I wounldn´t buy this beer if this was a shot in a commercial.  That´s not from a photographic viewpoint since this image is technically well done but the beer looks unflattering and stale, if the glass had been full with beer and with foam at the top and maybe a little moisture on the outside of the glass I would definately buy this product.  6 from me.', '2005-09-28 10:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
