(1746837, 236387, 41800, '<td valign="top">interesting  but most of the pic is extremely dark on my panel but when I move side to side and look at it from an angle that would normally wash out most images. It pops out in almost a 3D effect. Is that a special effect of some kind because it sure is cool.</td>', 'interesting  but most of the pic is extremely dark on my panel but when I move side to side and look at it from an angle that would normally wash out most images. It pops out in almost a 3D effect. Is that a special effect of some kind because it sure is cool.', '2005-09-28 22:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
