(1746868, 236966, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not too bad. 6. I think in this case the reflection in the glass hurt the composition as well as the light reflection on the bottle. Also feels like it needs to be rotated a few degrees clockwise.</td>', 'Not too bad. 6. I think in this case the reflection in the glass hurt the composition as well as the light reflection on the bottle. Also feels like it needs to be rotated a few degrees clockwise.', '2005-09-28 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
