(1746872, 236598, 41106, '<td valign="top">The near perfect symmetry is "clear" with the dissolved back rim of the bottom of the glass, etc.  The distance that fades is nearly mirror image.  Had it been perfect mirror, this image would not have been as intriguing.  It is the slight difference that makes the difference.   Good job.</td>', 'The near perfect symmetry is "clear" with the dissolved back rim of the bottom of the glass, etc.  The distance that fades is nearly mirror image.  Had it been perfect mirror, this image would not have been as intriguing.  It is the slight difference that makes the difference.   Good job.', '2005-09-28 22:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746874, 236786, 43380, '<td valign="top">I love the lack of DOF in this shot, the blue, as well as the white space.  My only change would be a little more definiton between the rear-rim of the glass and the background.  This is definitely top-tier this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'I love the lack of DOF in this shot, the blue, as well as the white space.  My only change would be a little more definiton between the rear-rim of the glass and the background.  This is definitely top-tier this challenge.  Good luck.', '2005-09-28 22:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
