(1746885, 237248, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like your take on the challenge. It looks like water to me though, not beer. Perhaps if you''d colored the water or used soda instead?</td>', 'I like your take on the challenge. It looks like water to me though, not beer. Perhaps if you''d colored the water or used soda instead?', '2005-09-28 22:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
