(1746894, 237388, 43380, '<td valign="top">I love the way that only the liquid is lit.  The colors and the composition are great.  With a little spot editing (if it were allowed) this could be a 10 for sure.  Without it, I''ll still give it a 9.  :)</td>', 'I love the way that only the liquid is lit.  The colors and the composition are great.  With a little spot editing (if it were allowed) this could be a 10 for sure.  Without it, I''ll still give it a 9.  :)', '2005-09-28 22:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
