(1746899, 235445, 41106, '<td valign="top">Perfect background for this "clean" image.  The sole color of the olive among variations of soft gray scale acromatics does not overwhelm the concept or theme.  Rather, the refraction at the liquid''s surface and the reflection counter to its placement say "BEVERAGE" more boldly than "OLIVE."   Good job.</td>', 'Perfect background for this "clean" image.  The sole color of the olive among variations of soft gray scale acromatics does not overwhelm the concept or theme.  Rather, the refraction at the liquid''s surface and the reflection counter to its placement say "BEVERAGE" more boldly than "OLIVE."   Good job.', '2005-09-28 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746911, 235246, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the subtilty of this one.</td>', 'I like the subtilty of this one.', '2005-09-28 22:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746918, 236973, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think the bottle on the right is more distracting than helpful.</td>', 'I think the bottle on the right is more distracting than helpful.', '2005-09-28 22:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746921, 237159, 43380, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors.  Could have done with editing out the crinkles in the back drop but since it''s not allowed, it''s still a 9.  Great job.</td>', 'Stunning colors.  Could have done with editing out the crinkles in the back drop but since it''s not allowed, it''s still a 9.  Great job.', '2005-09-28 22:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746922, 236990, 41106, '<td valign="top">While "beverage" is clearly suggested with the familiar repetitive labels, the darkness of the overall image looses essential definition that might have made a bolder statement of the theme.  Yet, this might have rendered your image "typical."  Such is the joy...and the quandry...of aesthetic choice.</td>', 'While "beverage" is clearly suggested with the familiar repetitive labels, the darkness of the overall image looses essential definition that might have made a bolder statement of the theme.  Yet, this might have rendered your image "typical."  Such is the joy...and the quandry...of aesthetic choice.', '2005-09-28 22:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746926, 237304, 3554, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really capture the spirit of the challenge in my mind. I don''t think water, in and of itself, is a beverage. Sea water, for example isn''t a beverage. And since this appears to be more a torture device, I just don''t see the connection between this and the challenge.</td>', 'This doesn''t really capture the spirit of the challenge in my mind. I don''t think water, in and of itself, is a beverage. Sea water, for example isn''t a beverage. And since this appears to be more a torture device, I just don''t see the connection between this and the challenge.', '2005-09-28 22:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746932, 237020, 41106, '<td valign="top">The format works well with this imagery.</td>', 'The format works well with this imagery.', '2005-09-28 22:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746935, 236990, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think if you had spaced these out a bit more it would have improved the composition. Not a bad shot, but the placement of the bottles could be improved.</td>', 'I think if you had spaced these out a bit more it would have improved the composition. Not a bad shot, but the placement of the bottles could be improved.', '2005-09-28 22:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746938, 235731, 29451, '<td valign="top">Definately the best in this challenge - well done.</td>', 'Definately the best in this challenge - well done.', '2005-09-28 22:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746940, 236876, 29451, '<td valign="top">One of the best in thh challenge - nicley done.</td>', 'One of the best in thh challenge - nicley done.', '2005-09-28 22:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746947, 235058, 3554, '<td valign="top">I love the use of light/color with the title. The subject seems like it could have been set up to better though. The clean dishes seem out of place and the paper towles don''t seem to be in the right spot...they are too prominent. The knife block would have been better where they are maybe...</td>', 'I love the use of light/color with the title. The subject seems like it could have been set up to better though. The clean dishes seem out of place and the paper towles don''t seem to be in the right spot...they are too prominent. The knife block would have been better where they are maybe...', '2005-09-28 22:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746951, 237295, 3554, '<td valign="top">Very creative</td>', 'Very creative', '2005-09-28 22:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746954, 236973, 43020, '<td valign="top">Great wine shot!  I find the bottle in the front right a little distracting though - perhaps a darker label would be better?</td>', 'Great wine shot!  I find the bottle in the front right a little distracting though - perhaps a darker label would be better?', '2005-09-28 22:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746961, 237036, 41106, '<td valign="top">This  is a nice composition, but a bit grainy.  Also, there is a bit of "background noise" (i.e. flora on wallpaper in left behind head) that competes for attention from the viewer.</td>', 'This  is a nice composition, but a bit grainy.  Also, there is a bit of "background noise" (i.e. flora on wallpaper in left behind head) that competes for attention from the viewer.', '2005-09-28 22:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746965, 235724, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think you have a nice still life here.  I would have liked to have seen either more titl or none at all.  In it''s current state, it feels to me that somebody didn''t check the viewfinder before shooting.  JMO.</td>', 'I think you have a nice still life here.  I would have liked to have seen either more titl or none at all.  In it''s current state, it feels to me that somebody didn''t check the viewfinder before shooting.  JMO.', '2005-09-28 22:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746967, 236910, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice entry, good light.</td>', 'Nice entry, good light.', '2005-09-28 22:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746969, 237348, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot..true colors.</td>', 'Nicely shot..true colors.', '2005-09-28 22:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746984, 236562, 45030, '<td valign="top">Where is the beverage?</td>', 'Where is the beverage?', '2005-09-28 22:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746986, 235814, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I wish you background was more interesting.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I wish you background was more interesting.', '2005-09-28 22:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746987, 237281, 41106, '<td valign="top">I like the uniqueness of this image as representative of the theme.  You can''t get much more basic beverage than this, unless you go with water.  Technically, nice detail, lighting, and depth of field.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the uniqueness of this image as representative of the theme.  You can''t get much more basic beverage than this, unless you go with water.  Technically, nice detail, lighting, and depth of field.  Good job.', '2005-09-28 22:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747001, 237387, 41106, '<td valign="top">The drastically shifiting scale of the masculine hand in the foreground vs. the delicate smaller hand in the middleground adds interest to this image that might have been mundane otherwise.  Setting all in front of neutral gray background works well.</td>', 'The drastically shifiting scale of the masculine hand in the foreground vs. the delicate smaller hand in the middleground adds interest to this image that might have been mundane otherwise.  Setting all in front of neutral gray background works well.', '2005-09-28 23:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747008, 237322, 41106, '<td valign="top">Cute young lady....beautiful hair.  I like the juxtaposition of the wholesomeness of the beverage vs. the connotations sometimes associated with leather.  This especially works well with the youthful subject.  Nice job.</td>', 'Cute young lady....beautiful hair.  I like the juxtaposition of the wholesomeness of the beverage vs. the connotations sometimes associated with leather.  This especially works well with the youthful subject.  Nice job.', '2005-09-28 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747028, 237311, 42570, '<td valign="top">use white balance or tungsten filter and a diffuser on the light that was above i can still see the reflection overall composition is good</td>', 'use white balance or tungsten filter and a diffuser on the light that was above i can still see the reflection overall composition is good', '2005-09-28 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747031, 235287, 42570, '<td valign="top">nice dof and tone i think however the angle of view should havebeen about 15 to 20 degrees</td>', 'nice dof and tone i think however the angle of view should havebeen about 15 to 20 degrees', '2005-09-28 23:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747034, 237304, 42570, '<td valign="top">what a face! good exposure nice freeze frame</td>', 'what a face! good exposure nice freeze frame', '2005-09-28 23:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747037, 235705, 42570, '<td valign="top">white balance for tungsten</td>', 'white balance for tungsten', '2005-09-28 23:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747042, 237024, 41106, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You are a great colorist.  Fauvists of the early 20th Century would love your work.</td>', 'Wow!  You are a great colorist.  Fauvists of the early 20th Century would love your work.', '2005-09-28 23:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747050, 237397, 41106, '<td valign="top">Creative play with the Collision Center noted on the key ring.  The shifted angle supports your message, as well.  Great advertisment for drinking / driving responsibly.</td>', 'Creative play with the Collision Center noted on the key ring.  The shifted angle supports your message, as well.  Great advertisment for drinking / driving responsibly.', '2005-09-28 23:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747056, 237147, 41106, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The tones say "warm", as one feels when they partake of such liquid delicacies cured in oak barrels.  Very nice job.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The tones say "warm", as one feels when they partake of such liquid delicacies cured in oak barrels.  Very nice job.', '2005-09-28 23:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747063, 235030, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m guessing you are trying to do poorly...I''ll give you a 10.</td>', 'Well, I''m guessing you are trying to do poorly...I''ll give you a 10.', '2005-09-28 23:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747089, 237134, 36619, '<td valign="top">wow! very pleasing composition!</td>', 'wow! very pleasing composition!', '2005-09-28 23:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747099, 237202, 36619, '<td valign="top">looks like an orange juice ad. :) this is just an amazing shot, 10.</td>', 'looks like an orange juice ad. :) this is just an amazing shot, 10.', '2005-09-28 23:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747101, 236026, 41106, '<td valign="top">I really love this image.  The sepia quality and the intense eyes of your subject are very mesmerizing.  Her hair suggests motion and/or movement, while alll else is very stil.  Excellent job.</td>', 'I really love this image.  The sepia quality and the intense eyes of your subject are very mesmerizing.  Her hair suggests motion and/or movement, while alll else is very stil.  Excellent job.', '2005-09-28 23:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747107, 235853, 36619, '<td valign="top">great lighting, it really pulls this together. i probably would have found the photo rather boring otherwise.</td>', 'great lighting, it really pulls this together. i probably would have found the photo rather boring otherwise.', '2005-09-28 23:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747108, 237391, 41800, '<td valign="top">good dof</td>', 'good dof', '2005-09-28 23:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747117, 236562, 35545, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with beverages?</td>', 'What does this have to do with beverages?', '2005-09-29 00:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747128, 236175, 41800, '<td valign="top">catches your interest immediately</td>', 'catches your interest immediately', '2005-09-29 00:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747129, 235253, 41106, '<td valign="top">Use of the complimentary colors of green and red is very effective in your image.  I realize this may be happenstance as lime is frequently associated with alcoholic beverage, but...nonetheless...I really like the overall appeal of this composition.  Reds and pinks are very representative of love, thus your title is very suitable.</td>', 'Use of the complimentary colors of green and red is very effective in your image.  I realize this may be happenstance as lime is frequently associated with alcoholic beverage, but...nonetheless...I really like the overall appeal of this composition.  Reds and pinks are very representative of love, thus your title is very suitable.', '2005-09-29 00:06:04.000000', NULL, 1);
