(1747175, 236562, 40718, '<td valign="top">remind me to come back and see your other pics and figure out why the hell people do this...</td>', 'remind me to come back and see your other pics and figure out why the hell people do this...', '2005-09-29 00:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747188, 237406, 41106, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this works well, especially in light of the "Light" that is highlighted in the label.  Very nice image...in "light" of everything.  :-)</td>', 'The lighting on this works well, especially in light of the "Light" that is highlighted in the label.  Very nice image...in "light" of everything.  :-)', '2005-09-29 00:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747189, 236786, 41800, '<td valign="top">nice shot but a little washed out. my eye is not drawn to the small droplet but rather to the white dot on the rim of the glass. I like the blue.</td>', 'nice shot but a little washed out. my eye is not drawn to the small droplet but rather to the white dot on the rim of the glass. I like the blue.', '2005-09-29 00:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747192, 237387, 41800, '<td valign="top">good DOF</td>', 'good DOF', '2005-09-29 00:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747199, 235731, 41800, '<td valign="top">creativity always works.</td>', 'creativity always works.', '2005-09-29 00:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747211, 236888, 41800, '<td valign="top">a little busy but would make a good jigsaw puzzle</td>', 'a little busy but would make a good jigsaw puzzle', '2005-09-29 00:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747219, 237110, 41800, '<td valign="top">nice sharp focus on subject</td>', 'nice sharp focus on subject', '2005-09-29 00:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747221, 235689, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish there was more overall focus. The overall bright orange tone is a bit much, but I do like the angle you chose to shoot from. Shows creativity.</td>', 'For me, I wish there was more overall focus. The overall bright orange tone is a bit much, but I do like the angle you chose to shoot from. Shows creativity.', '2005-09-29 00:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747226, 236879, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the shot and the colors. However, even though I know there is liquid in the glass, if I were to show this to someone and say, "guess the category" It might take them a while to come up with the word beverage.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the shot and the colors. However, even though I know there is liquid in the glass, if I were to show this to someone and say, "guess the category" It might take them a while to come up with the word beverage.', '2005-09-29 00:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747228, 237156, 41800, '<td valign="top">image is sharp from top to bottom</td>', 'image is sharp from top to bottom', '2005-09-29 00:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747230, 237273, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very cool shot. I absolutely love the colors. I wonder how this would be with a bit more cropped from the bottom, eliminating the overly dark area in the lower right hand corner? I like the composition as well. Good job and good luck.</td>', 'Wow! Very cool shot. I absolutely love the colors. I wonder how this would be with a bit more cropped from the bottom, eliminating the overly dark area in the lower right hand corner? I like the composition as well. Good job and good luck.', '2005-09-29 00:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747232, 235389, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the starkness, although some of the reflections off the cans themselves is a little harsh for me. Clever. The hairline red border is a nice touch.</td>', 'I like the concept and the starkness, although some of the reflections off the cans themselves is a little harsh for me. Clever. The hairline red border is a nice touch.', '2005-09-29 00:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747236, 237083, 41675, '<td valign="top">Yeah...that''s pretty nasty alright. I''m not a fan of post-editing filters (guess I''m kind of a photo purist, if you will). The noise doesn''t bother me as much, but it''s the lack of noise on the glass and the scorpion. Good composition though.</td>', 'Yeah...that''s pretty nasty alright. I''m not a fan of post-editing filters (guess I''m kind of a photo purist, if you will). The noise doesn''t bother me as much, but it''s the lack of noise on the glass and the scorpion. Good composition though.', '2005-09-29 00:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747240, 236409, 18799, '<td valign="top">The foreground object detract from this otherwise on topic image.</td>', 'The foreground object detract from this otherwise on topic image.', '2005-09-29 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747241, 237371, 41675, '<td valign="top">Overall I like this. The refelctions off the candles into the glass and onto the surface are nicely captured. The one thing that drags my eyes away are the red and bluish-green spots in the upper right. The subject is nearly centered, whereas I find if the focal point is slightly off center it adds more interest to the viewer.</td>', 'Overall I like this. The refelctions off the candles into the glass and onto the surface are nicely captured. The one thing that drags my eyes away are the red and bluish-green spots in the upper right. The subject is nearly centered, whereas I find if the focal point is slightly off center it adds more interest to the viewer.', '2005-09-29 00:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747246, 237134, 41675, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. I find that the thick black border is almost "squeezing" into the glass. Perhaps less cropping on the right hand side - thus giving the glass a bit more..."breathing room." I like the colors of the photo and the beverage. Made me chuckle when I saw the reflection of the...two people?</td>', 'Creative idea. I find that the thick black border is almost "squeezing" into the glass. Perhaps less cropping on the right hand side - thus giving the glass a bit more..."breathing room." I like the colors of the photo and the beverage. Made me chuckle when I saw the reflection of the...two people?', '2005-09-29 00:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747247, 235752, 41800, '<td valign="top">best splash I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'best splash I''ve seen so far.', '2005-09-29 00:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747248, 237092, 41675, '<td valign="top">If I were to see this image without knowing what "category" this was, it would take me a long time to think of beverage - even though there is liquid coming from his mouth. I do like the composition and the clarity of the fire is fantastic!</td>', 'If I were to see this image without knowing what "category" this was, it would take me a long time to think of beverage - even though there is liquid coming from his mouth. I do like the composition and the clarity of the fire is fantastic!', '2005-09-29 00:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747250, 237337, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. I wish there was more room at the bottom for the cut-off splash, but otherwise well done.</td>', 'I like the composition. I wish there was more room at the bottom for the cut-off splash, but otherwise well done.', '2005-09-29 00:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747256, 236197, 41800, '<td valign="top">Great shot but could have been better with out shiny reflecty object in background. straight black would of made it pop more and increased wow factor.</td>', 'Great shot but could have been better with out shiny reflecty object in background. straight black would of made it pop more and increased wow factor.', '2005-09-29 00:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747259, 235815, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think to work in this challenge, you have to have a perfect glass.  I find the scuff/smudge marks and scratches to be a distraction.</td>', 'I think to work in this challenge, you have to have a perfect glass.  I find the scuff/smudge marks and scratches to be a distraction.', '2005-09-29 00:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747262, 235410, 41800, '<td valign="top">guy in background looks evil</td>', 'guy in background looks evil', '2005-09-29 00:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747265, 235888, 41800, '<td valign="top">very artistic</td>', 'very artistic', '2005-09-29 01:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
