(1747792, 237390, 41675, '<td valign="top">This is such a tight closeup. I think it''s water, but then again... I wonder what this would look like if pulled back a bit to let the viewer more easily recognize what the object is instead of guessing?</td>', 'This is such a tight closeup. I think it''s water, but then again... I wonder what this would look like if pulled back a bit to let the viewer more easily recognize what the object is instead of guessing?', '2005-09-29 10:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747795, 235475, 41675, '<td valign="top">The strongest point of this photo for me is the waiter himself. It''s the nice contrast of his dark suit, hair and eyes against the rest of the photo. Eventually my eyes follow his along the line to the liquid, but invariably, they go back to him.</td>', 'The strongest point of this photo for me is the waiter himself. It''s the nice contrast of his dark suit, hair and eyes against the rest of the photo. Eventually my eyes follow his along the line to the liquid, but invariably, they go back to him.', '2005-09-29 10:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747796, 236598, 41675, '<td valign="top">With just a bit less harshness around the lower third of the background and maybe just a hint more sharpness (I like crisp photos) I would have scored it higher. Nice touch with the matching hairline border.</td>', 'With just a bit less harshness around the lower third of the background and maybe just a hint more sharpness (I like crisp photos) I would have scored it higher. Nice touch with the matching hairline border.', '2005-09-29 10:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747798, 236561, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, there would be more interest in the photo if the bottle itself were more in focus and maybe more off center. I always find photos more interesting if the main subject isn''t quite wo centered. The lighting is a bit strong here and there, but the limes are a nice touch.</td>', 'For me, there would be more interest in the photo if the bottle itself were more in focus and maybe more off center. I always find photos more interesting if the main subject isn''t quite wo centered. The lighting is a bit strong here and there, but the limes are a nice touch.', '2005-09-29 10:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747800, 237320, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice, refreshing (yes, pun intended) change from the multitude of glasses I''ve seen. I like the color treatment. The large white border is a bit overwhelming for me and I wish there was a bit more "breathing room" on the right hand side for the fountain, but overall - nicely done.</td>', 'A nice, refreshing (yes, pun intended) change from the multitude of glasses I''ve seen. I like the color treatment. The large white border is a bit overwhelming for me and I wish there was a bit more "breathing room" on the right hand side for the fountain, but overall - nicely done.', '2005-09-29 10:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747804, 237366, 41675, '<td valign="top">Even without your title, this phot speaks of romance. The lighting and colors set the mood and nicely so. The flame and glare reflections on the photo are a bit distracting, but I like the overall warm darkness of the shot. Good job. :-)</td>', 'Even without your title, this phot speaks of romance. The lighting and colors set the mood and nicely so. The flame and glare reflections on the photo are a bit distracting, but I like the overall warm darkness of the shot. Good job. :-)', '2005-09-29 10:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747805, 236026, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a sweet photo. For me, I wonder if this would look even better in black and white than sepia? It''s her eyes I find most captivating.</td>', 'What a sweet photo. For me, I wonder if this would look even better in black and white than sepia? It''s her eyes I find most captivating.', '2005-09-29 10:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747808, 237391, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....this seems to be a popular drink of choice around DPC :-) Nice advertisement for them. I like the colors of the bottles against the ice. Maybe a little busy, but not too bad.</td>', 'Hmmm....this seems to be a popular drink of choice around DPC :-) Nice advertisement for them. I like the colors of the bottles against the ice. Maybe a little busy, but not too bad.', '2005-09-29 10:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747810, 236966, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good composition for me. I wish the glass wasn''t cut off at the bottom, but I like the lighting and colors. Having the cap and opener adds interest as the photo would be boring without them. Well done and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good composition for me. I wish the glass wasn''t cut off at the bottom, but I like the lighting and colors. Having the cap and opener adds interest as the photo would be boring without them. Well done and good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-29 10:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747814, 237281, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha!!! too funny. Now, had there been a drop of milk there...! Points for humor.</td>', 'Ha ha ha!!! too funny. Now, had there been a drop of milk there...! Points for humor.', '2005-09-29 10:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747821, 235607, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I know you can easily clean brushes, but cleaning crayons? :-) Interesting entry. I would have liked to seen a bit more crispness overall and maybe a little more room on the left so that the glass itself wasn''t getting cut off.</td>', 'Hmmm...I know you can easily clean brushes, but cleaning crayons? :-) Interesting entry. I would have liked to seen a bit more crispness overall and maybe a little more room on the left so that the glass itself wasn''t getting cut off.', '2005-09-29 10:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747823, 236409, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bummer about that head in the lower left as it really takes away from the sweetness of the toast (your main subject). Good concept though. Next time, just politely ask him to duck :-)</td>', 'Bummer about that head in the lower left as it really takes away from the sweetness of the toast (your main subject). Good concept though. Next time, just politely ask him to duck :-)', '2005-09-29 10:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747827, 235054, 41675, '<td valign="top">Uhmmm, guessing this is a postcard or someting and you placed the beverage in front of it? The lighting from the background seems to be coming from one angle while the lighting on your glass appears to come from a  different angle.</td>', 'Uhmmm, guessing this is a postcard or someting and you placed the beverage in front of it? The lighting from the background seems to be coming from one angle while the lighting on your glass appears to come from a  different angle.', '2005-09-29 10:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747831, 235705, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. Nice still life. With a bit less yellow all around (the leaves look a little...sickly) I would have voted this higher. Good job.</td>', 'I like the composition. Nice still life. With a bit less yellow all around (the leaves look a little...sickly) I would have voted this higher. Good job.', '2005-09-29 10:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747834, 237265, 41675, '<td valign="top">The composition works okay for me. I wish there was a bit more to your background...say some ice or something to add more interest overall. This is the second "Kentucky beverage" shot I''ve seen. That stuff must taste pretty good. :-)</td>', 'The composition works okay for me. I wish there was a bit more to your background...say some ice or something to add more interest overall. This is the second "Kentucky beverage" shot I''ve seen. That stuff must taste pretty good. :-)', '2005-09-29 10:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747836, 235913, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the vibrancy of the bottles and liquid. The dust in the lower right is a bit distracting, but otherwise a "cool" shot (yeah, I know...bad pun)</td>', 'I like the vibrancy of the bottles and liquid. The dust in the lower right is a bit distracting, but otherwise a "cool" shot (yeah, I know...bad pun)', '2005-09-29 10:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747841, 235399, 41675, '<td valign="top">If I were given this photo and asked to guess the topic it would probably take me several tries to guess beverage. I wonder how this would look with the bean in the lower right cropped out even more? For me, this would keep my focus on your main subject, and lessen the distraction.</td>', 'If I were given this photo and asked to guess the topic it would probably take me several tries to guess beverage. I wonder how this would look with the bean in the lower right cropped out even more? For me, this would keep my focus on your main subject, and lessen the distraction.', '2005-09-29 10:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747843, 236387, 43714, '<td valign="top">Your shot is too dark.</td>', 'Your shot is too dark.', '2005-09-29 10:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747844, 234902, 41675, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, my eyes keep moving to the white mug in the background and not on your intended cup in the foreground. A bit more of that mug and less of the other, and I would have scored this better.</td>', 'Unfortunately, my eyes keep moving to the white mug in the background and not on your intended cup in the foreground. A bit more of that mug and less of the other, and I would have scored this better.', '2005-09-29 10:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747847, 235058, 41675, '<td valign="top">If someone gave me this phot and said, "guess the topic" I would guess kitchen or retro or dishes. I''m not sure I would come up with beverage. The yellow coloring was a little odd and striking at first, but the more I look at it, the less it bothers me.</td>', 'If someone gave me this phot and said, "guess the topic" I would guess kitchen or retro or dishes. I''m not sure I would come up with beverage. The yellow coloring was a little odd and striking at first, but the more I look at it, the less it bothers me.', '2005-09-29 10:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747850, 235269, 41675, '<td valign="top">Overall, the photo is a bit dark for me. The paper on the table is somewhat distracting, but I like the rectangular patterns created on the table by the window. Also, try making your photos slightly larger, using the 640 pixels or close to it as allowed by the rules. That will also have a greater impact to the voters.</td>', 'Overall, the photo is a bit dark for me. The paper on the table is somewhat distracting, but I like the rectangular patterns created on the table by the window. Also, try making your photos slightly larger, using the 640 pixels or close to it as allowed by the rules. That will also have a greater impact to the voters.', '2005-09-29 10:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747855, 235545, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part is the lighting and moisture. My least favorite part is that it is set dead center and therefore lacks interest for me. Had it been slightly offset to one side or the other, I would have scored it a point higher.</td>', 'My favorite part is the lighting and moisture. My least favorite part is that it is set dead center and therefore lacks interest for me. Had it been slightly offset to one side or the other, I would have scored it a point higher.', '2005-09-29 10:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
