(1748076, 236740, 43380, '<td valign="top">I love that you didn''t choose a white background.  The tan''ish color makes it seem "dirtier".   One criticism thought; the reflections in the glass are a little distracting (it looks like there maybe a tv on to the left.)  This is a shot that would be fun to hang in the kitchen.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love that you didn''t choose a white background.  The tan''ish color makes it seem "dirtier".   One criticism thought; the reflections in the glass are a little distracting (it looks like there maybe a tv on to the left.)  This is a shot that would be fun to hang in the kitchen.  Good luck!', '2005-09-29 12:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748090, 236065, 43380, '<td valign="top">I think this idea is great but maybe executed a little better it could have been a great shot.  If the image weren''t so white.  The tea-bag is hardly visible...however, that may have been what you were going for...it looks like the tea is just suspended.  The drip a great added spark.</td>', 'I think this idea is great but maybe executed a little better it could have been a great shot.  If the image weren''t so white.  The tea-bag is hardly visible...however, that may have been what you were going for...it looks like the tea is just suspended.  The drip a great added spark.', '2005-09-29 12:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748095, 235731, 43380, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s horrible!  What self respecting Pepsi would want to be a Coke?  Fun shot though, shows that we all have a little something in us that wants to be something else...  I think the lighting was good and the DOF was just right.  My only thought would be the rear-rim blending with the back drop.  As a Pepsi fan, I''ll give it an 8.  :)</td>', 'Oh that''s horrible!  What self respecting Pepsi would want to be a Coke?  Fun shot though, shows that we all have a little something in us that wants to be something else...  I think the lighting was good and the DOF was just right.  My only thought would be the rear-rim blending with the back drop.  As a Pepsi fan, I''ll give it an 8.  :)', '2005-09-29 12:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748101, 237318, 43380, '<td valign="top">Intriguing...this shot leaves me wondering what the drink is.  Ginger ale?  Light beer?  Rum and Coke?  I''m having a hard time getting a focus point but I love the POV.</td>', 'Intriguing...this shot leaves me wondering what the drink is.  Ginger ale?  Light beer?  Rum and Coke?  I''m having a hard time getting a focus point but I love the POV.', '2005-09-29 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748104, 236713, 43380, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get some questions about the lighting but I like it.  My only suggestion would be to clone out the upper rim so the color just seems to fade from the shot without reappearing near the top.  I''m having an issue with lower right part of the glass also...it looks weird.  But I think that colors are fantastic and the lighting is unique.  Good job!</td>', 'You''ll probably get some questions about the lighting but I like it.  My only suggestion would be to clone out the upper rim so the color just seems to fade from the shot without reappearing near the top.  I''m having an issue with lower right part of the glass also...it looks weird.  But I think that colors are fantastic and the lighting is unique.  Good job!', '2005-09-29 12:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748109, 237273, 43380, '<td valign="top">Neat!  The purple tint is really great.  The bubbles are great for the texture of the water.  Looks like this shot would have been a lot of fun!</td>', 'Neat!  The purple tint is really great.  The bubbles are great for the texture of the water.  Looks like this shot would have been a lot of fun!', '2005-09-29 12:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748114, 235475, 43380, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see the pouring without it being right in front of the tree...it''s a little distracting but i know that with a candid shot it''s not possible to control the background.  On that note, I think that its a fun shot that is great for being candid.  The contrast is just right in my mind.</td>', 'I would have loved to see the pouring without it being right in front of the tree...it''s a little distracting but i know that with a candid shot it''s not possible to control the background.  On that note, I think that its a fun shot that is great for being candid.  The contrast is just right in my mind.', '2005-09-29 12:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748135, 237311, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how the forground glass is laying on the table. From the title, I guess I expected to see more of the "red" in the wine, whereas it looks alot darker - almost to the point of black. I wonder how this would look if you also added some other element and off centered the glasses to add interest?</td>', 'I like how the forground glass is laying on the table. From the title, I guess I expected to see more of the "red" in the wine, whereas it looks alot darker - almost to the point of black. I wonder how this would look if you also added some other element and off centered the glasses to add interest?', '2005-09-29 13:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748137, 236928, 41675, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was - "don''t let it fall off". The angle is a bit too much for me. I wish there was a bit more light overall. Without the red of the wine this is almost a monochrome or black and white photo (that''s not necessarily a bad thing). For me, having another element somewhere in the photo would add interest.</td>', 'My first reaction was - "don''t let it fall off". The angle is a bit too much for me. I wish there was a bit more light overall. Without the red of the wine this is almost a monochrome or black and white photo (that''s not necessarily a bad thing). For me, having another element somewhere in the photo would add interest.', '2005-09-29 13:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748139, 235731, 19952, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! Very good setup and the execution/lighting turned out great. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Cool shot! Very good setup and the execution/lighting turned out great. Very nicely done.', '2005-09-29 13:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748141, 237331, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - I definitely get a sense of motion and speed from your photo. If someone gave this to me and asked me what the topic was, I wouldn''t say beverage though. Industrial or factory, or automation, but not beverage.</td>', 'Wow - I definitely get a sense of motion and speed from your photo. If someone gave this to me and asked me what the topic was, I wouldn''t say beverage though. Industrial or factory, or automation, but not beverage.', '2005-09-29 13:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
