(1748410, 237400, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the colour contrast, the blue in the glasses contrasts very well with the red backround.  However, my eye ist still a little bit distracted by the strong lines in the backround and I keep looking at the backround instead of the glasses but it doesn´t hurt the image too much and I still gave it an 8 as this is pretty well executed technically.</td>', 'Love the colour contrast, the blue in the glasses contrasts very well with the red backround.  However, my eye ist still a little bit distracted by the strong lines in the backround and I keep looking at the backround instead of the glasses but it doesn´t hurt the image too much and I still gave it an 8 as this is pretty well executed technically.', '2005-09-29 14:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748411, 235203, 43565, '<td valign="top">I personally find the shadows distracting.</td>', 'I personally find the shadows distracting.', '2005-09-29 14:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
