(1749621, 236751, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the composition of the plate, napkin, etc. I wonder how this would have looked with only the one glass or moving the other glass closer so it wasn''t cut off?</td>', 'I like the concept and the composition of the plate, napkin, etc. I wonder how this would have looked with only the one glass or moving the other glass closer so it wasn''t cut off?', '2005-09-30 00:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
