(1749841, 236061, 8178, '<td valign="top">Good focus, nice color. I would have liked to see the rest of the mug on the top. 9</td>', 'Good focus, nice color. I would have liked to see the rest of the mug on the top. 9', '2005-09-30 03:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
