(1749867, 237276, 40019, '<td valign="top">$.50!!  You''re definitely not in California!  I haven''t seen $.50 Coke since the ''80''s!  Great picture - I liked it a lot!  Great use of colors!</td>', '$.50!!  You''re definitely not in California!  I haven''t seen $.50 Coke since the ''80''s!  Great picture - I liked it a lot!  Great use of colors!', '2005-09-30 04:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749868, 237248, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Hope you didn''t need to many takes to net this shot!  What a mess, :-)</td>', 'Very cool!  Hope you didn''t need to many takes to net this shot!  What a mess, :-)', '2005-09-30 04:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749887, 235724, 40081, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it more straightened, with a less wrinkled background and with more exposure on the wine glass instead of the candle</td>', 'I would have liked it more straightened, with a less wrinkled background and with more exposure on the wine glass instead of the candle', '2005-09-30 04:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749891, 237044, 40081, '<td valign="top">Would have liked the bottle more in focus<br/>The overexposed background in the left upper corner distracts me from the beverage</td>', 'Would have liked the bottle more in focusThe overexposed background in the left upper corner distracts me from the beverage', '2005-09-30 04:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749892, 237370, 40081, '<td valign="top">Seems too cropped without enough resolution as a result.<br/>The whites are overexposed to my taste<br/>The composition might have been more pleasing if the pole would not have been so dominant in the view</td>', 'Seems too cropped without enough resolution as a result.The whites are overexposed to my tasteThe composition might have been more pleasing if the pole would not have been so dominant in the view', '2005-09-30 04:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749893, 235083, 40081, '<td valign="top">Great ad picture. Nice lighting. 8</td>', 'Great ad picture. Nice lighting. 8', '2005-09-30 04:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749897, 237295, 40081, '<td valign="top">Hahaha. Excellent. Would maybe have liked it even better with the cup from the other angle - 8</td>', 'Hahaha. Excellent. Would maybe have liked it even better with the cup from the other angle - 8', '2005-09-30 05:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749899, 236409, 40081, '<td valign="top">The flowers are distracting to me. It also seems there is not enough focus and/or resolution</td>', 'The flowers are distracting to me. It also seems there is not enough focus and/or resolution', '2005-09-30 05:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749906, 237366, 18219, '<td valign="top">it almost looks like a shrine!<br/>but nice color useage and composition</td>', 'it almost looks like a shrine!but nice color useage and composition', '2005-09-30 05:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749907, 236050, 18219, '<td valign="top">good idea, nicely excecuted.<br/>i''m not sure I like the table lines though.<br/>a small nit pick, but i had to have something i didn''t like about the picture :-)</td>', 'good idea, nicely excecuted.i''m not sure I like the table lines though.a small nit pick, but i had to have something i didn''t like about the picture :-)', '2005-09-30 05:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749908, 236990, 18219, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting on this one.<br/>very well done.</td>', 'i like the lighting on this one.very well done.', '2005-09-30 05:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749910, 235706, 18219, '<td valign="top">applying the rule of thirds would have made this a bit more interesting-to me anyway :-)<br/>and maybe a different colored umbrella to make it stand out more.<br/>but a nice idea none the less.</td>', 'applying the rule of thirds would have made this a bit more interesting-to me anyway :-)and maybe a different colored umbrella to make it stand out more.but a nice idea none the less.', '2005-09-30 05:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749911, 237325, 18219, '<td valign="top">wow, your floor is dirty!!!<br/>just kidding.<br/>a nice nostalgic picture.</td>', 'wow, your floor is dirty!!!just kidding.a nice nostalgic picture.', '2005-09-30 05:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749912, 237348, 18219, '<td valign="top">i don''t think the bottles in the background add anything to this picture, at least not with silver backing there-it gives it a kind of "cheap" feel to it and not a top shelf feel.<br/>But i do like how the cork is laying there :-)</td>', 'i don''t think the bottles in the background add anything to this picture, at least not with silver backing there-it gives it a kind of "cheap" feel to it and not a top shelf feel.But i do like how the cork is laying there :-)', '2005-09-30 05:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749936, 237348, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and good sharpness, technically this is pretty well done.  However, I have to put a questionmark about your composition, I don´t understand why you have all that room to the left of the vodka bottle and then cut off part of the martini glass on the right, I would have liked this shot a whole lot better if it wasn´t like that and also I feel that the top of the bottle should be in the shot.  Just my 2 cents and if you disagree I totally respect that, this is just my opinion.  (5)</td>', 'Nicely lit and good sharpness, technically this is pretty well done.  However, I have to put a questionmark about your composition, I don´t understand why you have all that room to the left of the vodka bottle and then cut off part of the martini glass on the right, I would have liked this shot a whole lot better if it wasn´t like that and also I feel that the top of the bottle should be in the shot.  Just my 2 cents and if you disagree I totally respect that, this is just my opinion.  (5)', '2005-09-30 07:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749979, 237311, 18799, '<td valign="top">Something that jumps right out at me about this image is the reflection of the clamp light on the glass.  I don''t know how you would have lit it to avoid the problem, but it is a definate flaw.</td>', 'Something that jumps right out at me about this image is the reflection of the clamp light on the glass.  I don''t know how you would have lit it to avoid the problem, but it is a definate flaw.', '2005-09-30 08:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750021, 236392, 36456, '<td valign="top">looks a bit dirty ?</td>', 'looks a bit dirty ?', '2005-09-30 09:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750030, 236387, 36456, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2005-09-30 09:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750032, 235058, 36456, '<td valign="top">should have sorted out the white balance, but prehaps that what you were aiming for ?</td>', 'should have sorted out the white balance, but prehaps that what you were aiming for ?', '2005-09-30 09:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750033, 236978, 36456, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2005-09-30 09:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750051, 235244, 36456, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2005-09-30 09:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750132, 236025, 43565, '<td valign="top">What time is dinner?</td>', 'What time is dinner?', '2005-09-30 10:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750166, 237388, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very nice!I love the colors and the crispness of the bubbles. It might have been better without the blue bands around the glass and the liquid pouring into the glass. Good job!</td>', 'Very nice!I love the colors and the crispness of the bubbles. It might have been better without the blue bands around the glass and the liquid pouring into the glass. Good job!', '2005-09-30 11:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750232, 236392, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks extremely jummy and I want one.  The backround fits perfectly with the image.  However, the image is a bit dark and flat for my taste, I bet I would like it a whole lot more with a simple "s-curve".  (6)</td>', 'Looks extremely jummy and I want one.  The backround fits perfectly with the image.  However, the image is a bit dark and flat for my taste, I bet I would like it a whole lot more with a simple "s-curve".  (6)', '2005-09-30 11:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750258, 236762, 21216, '<td valign="top">I love the flow of the juice in this picture and this would make for such a lovely picture if only it was executed right. The flash is really out of place and makes an ugly glare on the glass (That also brings out the dirtiness of the glass), the background is wrong, for such a commercial idea a white background would have been better. And the composition is too inyourface kind of, the subjects too close. You''re on the right path but you''re using the wrong shoes.</td>', 'I love the flow of the juice in this picture and this would make for such a lovely picture if only it was executed right. The flash is really out of place and makes an ugly glare on the glass (That also brings out the dirtiness of the glass), the background is wrong, for such a commercial idea a white background would have been better. And the composition is too inyourface kind of, the subjects too close. You''re on the right path but you''re using the wrong shoes.', '2005-09-30 12:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750263, 236050, 21216, '<td valign="top">Great tilted image! Great idea, great reflections. Everything''s great but well it''s only great, the compostion is a little weak, you should have listened to the rules instead of being an anarchist ;-) Anyway this could also make a great picture for complimentary colors, oh and also keep in mind that making the colors as well as the lighting pop attracts more interest.</td>', 'Great tilted image! Great idea, great reflections. Everything''s great but well it''s only great, the compostion is a little weak, you should have listened to the rules instead of being an anarchist ;-) Anyway this could also make a great picture for complimentary colors, oh and also keep in mind that making the colors as well as the lighting pop attracts more interest.', '2005-09-30 12:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750275, 236387, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea at all but it´s a little bit dark for my taste, so dark I can´t make out any details at all in the shot so I ony gave it a 4.</td>', 'Not a bad idea at all but it´s a little bit dark for my taste, so dark I can´t make out any details at all in the shot so I ony gave it a 4.', '2005-09-30 12:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750277, 237140, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like this shot but I would have liked it heaps more if you could have lit the bottle the same amount but the glass a little more and another combination of shutterspeed, aperture and ISO would let you get some texture to the flames, then this image would have been superb.  (7)</td>', 'Nicely done, I like this shot but I would have liked it heaps more if you could have lit the bottle the same amount but the glass a little more and another combination of shutterspeed, aperture and ISO would let you get some texture to the flames, then this image would have been superb.  (7)', '2005-09-30 12:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750344, 235545, 18073, '<td valign="top">Superby lit and nice and sharp.  Simple but effective, well done!</td>', 'Superby lit and nice and sharp.  Simple but effective, well done!', '2005-09-30 12:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750403, 236165, 43380, '<td valign="top">I like that the backdrop fads up at the same time with the color of the beer.  I''m not sure if that''s what you were going for but it''s a nice touch.  Alos, I like the way the logo on the glass isn''t centered.  All together I think it''s a nice shot.  Would make a great beer ad.</td>', 'I like that the backdrop fads up at the same time with the color of the beer.  I''m not sure if that''s what you were going for but it''s a nice touch.  Alos, I like the way the logo on the glass isn''t centered.  All together I think it''s a nice shot.  Would make a great beer ad.', '2005-09-30 13:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
