(1751802, 235740, 24983, '<td valign="top">there is a bit of background clutter but this is a real cool shot a bit contrived but I personally like it .10</td>', 'there is a bit of background clutter but this is a real cool shot a bit contrived but I personally like it .10', '2005-10-01 05:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751803, 237276, 24983, '<td valign="top">this works for me 10</td>', 'this works for me 10', '2005-10-01 05:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751804, 235445, 40081, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The one small remark I have is that the light background "hides" somewhat the splashing Martini.</td>', 'Very nice. The one small remark I have is that the light background "hides" somewhat the splashing Martini.', '2005-10-01 05:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751805, 236067, 24983, '<td valign="top">I really like this image it is nicely posed without being too contrived the lighting is well handled as well 10</td>', 'I really like this image it is nicely posed without being too contrived the lighting is well handled as well 10', '2005-10-01 05:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751806, 237256, 24983, '<td valign="top">this has been so well caught I like it a lot 10</td>', 'this has been so well caught I like it a lot 10', '2005-10-01 05:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751807, 235253, 24983, '<td valign="top">I like the colour range and the composition 9</td>', 'I like the colour range and the composition 9', '2005-10-01 05:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751808, 235410, 40081, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very attractive picture. Sell it to Corona for their next ad.<br/>Great use of DOF.</td>', 'Wow. Very attractive picture. Sell it to Corona for their next ad.Great use of DOF.', '2005-10-01 05:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751809, 237083, 24983, '<td valign="top">brings the message home</td>', 'brings the message home', '2005-10-01 05:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751811, 237075, 24983, '<td valign="top">very well done the image got my eye 9</td>', 'very well done the image got my eye 9', '2005-10-01 05:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751812, 235752, 40081, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I do not like the table, the wrinkled background though.</td>', 'Great idea. I do not like the table, the wrinkled background though.', '2005-10-01 05:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751813, 237416, 24983, '<td valign="top">A good story shot the model looks a little self consious perhaps leaning him against the truck more would have worked  9</td>', 'A good story shot the model looks a little self consious perhaps leaning him against the truck more would have worked  9', '2005-10-01 05:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751814, 236713, 24983, '<td valign="top">the colours and the eddying if them together with the light make this a winner 9</td>', 'the colours and the eddying if them together with the light make this a winner 9', '2005-10-01 05:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751815, 236606, 24983, '<td valign="top">great image the colour and minimilism make this shot for me  9</td>', 'great image the colour and minimilism make this shot for me  9', '2005-10-01 06:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751816, 235475, 40081, '<td valign="top">Very nice and authentic. A pity that the tree is such a distracting background for the main action. For me, it could have been a winner if you would have been positioned one meter more to the right.</td>', 'Very nice and authentic. A pity that the tree is such a distracting background for the main action. For me, it could have been a winner if you would have been positioned one meter more to the right.', '2005-10-01 06:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751817, 235480, 24983, '<td valign="top">wow this is a shot with action well done 9</td>', 'wow this is a shot with action well done 9', '2005-10-01 06:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751818, 236441, 24983, '<td valign="top">this has a lovely olde world feel about it which really makes me feel happy, It has a Norman Rockwell feeling of something we have all experienced 9</td>', 'this has a lovely olde world feel about it which really makes me feel happy, It has a Norman Rockwell feeling of something we have all experienced 9', '2005-10-01 06:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751819, 236910, 24983, '<td valign="top">this is a common occurance!!!!!! but well photographed 9</td>', 'this is a common occurance!!!!!! but well photographed 9', '2005-10-01 06:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751820, 236264, 24983, '<td valign="top">the red reflection really works for this image 8</td>', 'the red reflection really works for this image 8', '2005-10-01 06:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751822, 237281, 24983, '<td valign="top">I thought this was original and delightful image give you an 8 pity about the grass branch in front .</td>', 'I thought this was original and delightful image give you an 8 pity about the grass branch in front .', '2005-10-01 06:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751835, 237162, 44952, '<td valign="top">is the tube the drink<br/>nice black &amp; white photo</td>', 'is the tube the drinknice black & white photo', '2005-10-01 06:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751838, 236928, 44952, '<td valign="top">i like how there is black and white then the crimson it is creative<br/>and i also like how it is on a slope it is also very very good</td>', 'i like how there is black and white then the crimson it is creativeand i also like how it is on a slope it is also very very good', '2005-10-01 06:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751842, 237092, 44952, '<td valign="top">WOW this is mad i cant belive it.</td>', 'WOW this is mad i cant belive it.', '2005-10-01 06:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751843, 235995, 44952, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2005-10-01 06:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751844, 235545, 44952, '<td valign="top">yummmmm</td>', 'yummmmm', '2005-10-01 06:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751877, 237256, 40973, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-17 12:43:54.</i></td>', '.', '2005-10-01 08:07:04.000000', '2006-08-17 13:43:54.000000', 1),
(1751895, 235746, 44534, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve nailed it!  Outstanding photo!!!  I better you''d rather be there than working! I really like the way the sand pebbles reflect the light.</td>', 'I think you''ve nailed it!  Outstanding photo!!!  I better you''d rather be there than working! I really like the way the sand pebbles reflect the light.', '2005-10-01 08:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751917, 235705, 42389, '<td valign="top">Delicate and beautiful. cheers! 9</td>', 'Delicate and beautiful. cheers! 9', '2005-10-01 09:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751920, 237402, 42389, '<td valign="top">Good composition and contrast.</td>', 'Good composition and contrast.', '2005-10-01 09:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751921, 236441, 42389, '<td valign="top">Ansolutely love the soft tones of this image.</td>', 'Ansolutely love the soft tones of this image.', '2005-10-01 09:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751931, 237154, 42389, '<td valign="top">Distracting... Killer instinct in the eyes. but teeth are awful! They ruin the mood IMO.<br/>This vampire needs good dentist =)</td>', 'Distracting... Killer instinct in the eyes. but teeth are awful! They ruin the mood IMO.This vampire needs good dentist =)', '2005-10-01 09:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752023, 237147, 44575, '<td valign="top">I really love the staging with the sawdust and tools.  Its a bit dark (the bottles  should stand out a bit more, IMO) and the focus seems a bit off.</td>', 'I really love the staging with the sawdust and tools.  Its a bit dark (the bottles  should stand out a bit more, IMO) and the focus seems a bit off.', '2005-10-01 11:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752026, 236165, 44754, '<td valign="top">Havn''t had a black and tan in a long time. The lighting looks alittle off to me. Youy can see the light box superimposed right over the darkest part of the drink which takes away from the deep richness that could have been there. Change the light and add more of a head on top and "bam", you got it.</td>', 'Havn''t had a black and tan in a long time. The lighting looks alittle off to me. Youy can see the light box superimposed right over the darkest part of the drink which takes away from the deep richness that could have been there. Change the light and add more of a head on top and "bam", you got it.', '2005-10-01 11:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752027, 235895, 44754, '<td valign="top">Kinda nasty</td>', 'Kinda nasty', '2005-10-01 11:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752028, 237337, 44575, '<td valign="top">I like the lack of color here.  The black and white with just a punch of the yellow label really works.</td>', 'I like the lack of color here.  The black and white with just a punch of the yellow label really works.', '2005-10-01 11:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752029, 237370, 44754, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to look at. Nobody seems to be drinking anything. I see one bottle of water and a pitcher of iced tea, but you have to look for it. Where''s Waldo meets where is the drink.</td>', 'Not sure what to look at. Nobody seems to be drinking anything. I see one bottle of water and a pitcher of iced tea, but you have to look for it. Where''s Waldo meets where is the drink.', '2005-10-01 11:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752032, 235706, 44754, '<td valign="top">Now thats a tall glass of lemonade.</td>', 'Now thats a tall glass of lemonade.', '2005-10-01 11:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752034, 237043, 44575, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t work for me.  Its dark, the beverage isn''t really the focus of the picture (the fire is, IMO), and it seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'This just doesn''t work for me.  Its dark, the beverage isn''t really the focus of the picture (the fire is, IMO), and it seems a bit out of focus.', '2005-10-01 11:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752036, 234902, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think you need a little more depth of focus.  The handle is in sharp focus, but I think the rest of the coffee cup should be as well.</td>', 'I think you need a little more depth of focus.  The handle is in sharp focus, but I think the rest of the coffee cup should be as well.', '2005-10-01 11:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752037, 237311, 44754, '<td valign="top">Very boring. Too much sediment in glass. Lighting needs to come from behind the glass with the wine in it to bring out the beautiful color of the wine. Set this up infront of some green foliage or better yet on a stool or small table in a vineyard and you''d have a much better image.</td>', 'Very boring. Too much sediment in glass. Lighting needs to come from behind the glass with the wine in it to bring out the beautiful color of the wine. Set this up infront of some green foliage or better yet on a stool or small table in a vineyard and you''d have a much better image.', '2005-10-01 11:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752041, 237322, 44575, '<td valign="top">A cute idea, but I would have cropped much more closely to the face.  There is a lot of white space that doesn''t contribute anything to the picture and neither does the left arm.</td>', 'A cute idea, but I would have cropped much more closely to the face.  There is a lot of white space that doesn''t contribute anything to the picture and neither does the left arm.', '2005-10-01 11:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752043, 235475, 44754, '<td valign="top">Love it. My only comment, do a little editing and take his name badge out of there. My eye is almost immediately drawn to that big white badge on black jacket. Other then that I think this is a great shot.</td>', 'Love it. My only comment, do a little editing and take his name badge out of there. My eye is almost immediately drawn to that big white badge on black jacket. Other then that I think this is a great shot.', '2005-10-01 11:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752047, 235752, 44754, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the table. Not to mention the drops of red on the table from the splash.</td>', 'Don''t like the table. Not to mention the drops of red on the table from the splash.', '2005-10-01 11:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752048, 237202, 44754, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2005-10-01 11:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752049, 236703, 44575, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a underexposed -- I''d like to see a whiter background.  The whole color cast of the photo seems a bit off -- kind of muddy.  The colors are the real subject here, so they should really pop.  The backdrop needs to be ironed -- the wrinkles are really distracting.  Same for the drops on the left-most glass.</td>', 'This seems to be a underexposed -- I''d like to see a whiter background.  The whole color cast of the photo seems a bit off -- kind of muddy.  The colors are the real subject here, so they should really pop.  The backdrop needs to be ironed -- the wrinkles are really distracting.  Same for the drops on the left-most glass.', '2005-10-01 11:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752052, 235253, 44754, '<td valign="top">Very soothing. I just don''t like the pink backround. The drink seems to blend in with it. I think the backround should contrast the drink and plate more to help it stand out a bit. The lime is a nice contrast but use bit more color and vibrant adjustment.</td>', 'Very soothing. I just don''t like the pink backround. The drink seems to blend in with it. I think the backround should contrast the drink and plate more to help it stand out a bit. The lime is a nice contrast but use bit more color and vibrant adjustment.', '2005-10-01 11:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752053, 236387, 44575, '<td valign="top">Way underexposed.  I like the idea, but you can barely tell what''s in the glass!</td>', 'Way underexposed.  I like the idea, but you can barely tell what''s in the glass!', '2005-10-01 11:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752055, 237149, 44754, '<td valign="top">Show some of the actual beverage and I think you''d have a better image.</td>', 'Show some of the actual beverage and I think you''d have a better image.', '2005-10-01 11:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752057, 237227, 44575, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept.  Vertical blinds make a distracting backdrop, though.   I think it would be better composed with a closer crop and better angle on the letter (maybe so the viewer could read "Dear John").</td>', 'An interesting concept.  Vertical blinds make a distracting backdrop, though.   I think it would be better composed with a closer crop and better angle on the letter (maybe so the viewer could read "Dear John").', '2005-10-01 11:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752058, 236876, 44754, '<td valign="top">I like the imagery, but to me the smoke seems to take away from the shot. If there is some someway for you get that big puff of smoke from the upper left corner I would like it even more.</td>', 'I like the imagery, but to me the smoke seems to take away from the shot. If there is some someway for you get that big puff of smoke from the upper left corner I would like it even more.', '2005-10-01 11:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
