(1752731, 235030, 42638, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is. I like the colors you were going for. Looks like the framing was good too. I''m sure others have commented on the exposure or focus on it.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is. I like the colors you were going for. Looks like the framing was good too. I''m sure others have commented on the exposure or focus on it.', '2005-10-01 18:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
