(1752733, 237036, 40667, '<td valign="top">for some reason this photo seems to be very grainy! i''m interested to see what type of camera your using because that may be it! if i were you, i would have cropped it back to take out more of the distracting shirt.</td>', 'for some reason this photo seems to be very grainy! i''m interested to see what type of camera your using because that may be it! if i were you, i would have cropped it back to take out more of the distracting shirt.', '2005-10-01 18:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
