(1752854, 237266, 41574, '<td valign="top">It''s nice and sharp. The box has attractive, vibrant colors. That''s about all I can say, that''s positive, about this picture. Sorry, but it''s just not very creative.</td>', 'It''s nice and sharp. The box has attractive, vibrant colors. That''s about all I can say, that''s positive, about this picture. Sorry, but it''s just not very creative.', '2005-10-01 20:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
