(1754082, 237033, 42714, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, think it could''ve benefited from a tad more negative space for effect.</td>', 'I really like this photo, think it could''ve benefited from a tad more negative space for effect.', '2005-10-02 18:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754085, 237036, 42714, '<td valign="top">This is suffering from a few things...firstly, there''s a lot of noise in the photograph and it''s lacking any focus.  Compositionally, this could benefit from a few things, but the biggest is the glass itself.  Hard to get the gist of orange juice in a blue cup. :)</td>', 'This is suffering from a few things...firstly, there''s a lot of noise in the photograph and it''s lacking any focus.  Compositionally, this could benefit from a few things, but the biggest is the glass itself.  Hard to get the gist of orange juice in a blue cup. :)', '2005-10-02 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754087, 236067, 42714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of sihouette and using the implied versus the obvious.</td>', 'Wonderful use of sihouette and using the implied versus the obvious.', '2005-10-02 18:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754090, 235389, 42714, '<td valign="top">A lot of hot spots here - I think this is a case where this could benefit from a dark background versus a white one, to really bring out those cans.</td>', 'A lot of hot spots here - I think this is a case where this could benefit from a dark background versus a white one, to really bring out those cans.', '2005-10-02 18:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754098, 236966, 42714, '<td valign="top">I think you have a choice here in composition...a) using more negative space, therefore giving more a sense of place to the assorted objects...or b) bringing the obects closer together and doing a major crop in the lens.  Right now, it seems too much halfway between, so there''s nothing really holding it together.</td>', 'I think you have a choice here in composition...a) using more negative space, therefore giving more a sense of place to the assorted objects...or b) bringing the obects closer together and doing a major crop in the lens.  Right now, it seems too much halfway between, so there''s nothing really holding it together.', '2005-10-02 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754107, 237110, 42714, '<td valign="top">Great complimentary colors, very subtle uses of oranges and greens.  The appearance of the plant from above really adds to the framing of this piece.</td>', 'Great complimentary colors, very subtle uses of oranges and greens.  The appearance of the plant from above really adds to the framing of this piece.', '2005-10-02 18:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754111, 235206, 42714, '<td valign="top">Good piece of photography, could definitely belong in a magazine.</td>', 'Good piece of photography, could definitely belong in a magazine.', '2005-10-02 18:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754114, 236990, 42714, '<td valign="top">Fantastic understanding of background and what it can do if similar to the actual object in the foreground.</td>', 'Fantastic understanding of background and what it can do if similar to the actual object in the foreground.', '2005-10-02 18:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754121, 235399, 42714, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, I didn''t have a comment on the actual photo, but the title...I personally think "coffee" would do just fine, allows for the viewer to fully appreciate the interpretation without being blatant. :)</td>', 'Very nice photo, I didn''t have a comment on the actual photo, but the title...I personally think "coffee" would do just fine, allows for the viewer to fully appreciate the interpretation without being blatant. :)', '2005-10-02 18:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
