(1754134, 236409, 42714, '<td valign="top">You know, I LOVE the toast...I can''t help but feeling the flowers and vase, even with the shallow depth-of-field is too distracting.</td>', 'You know, I LOVE the toast...I can''t help but feeling the flowers and vase, even with the shallow depth-of-field is too distracting.', '2005-10-02 18:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
