(1755893, 235557, 9690, '<td valign="top">I love Bailey''s.... Try Baileys, Kahlua, and vanilla ice cream blended together... just beautiful.  I like this pic, and, for the most part, I like the lighting.  It is a bit harsh, however, on the right which causes a dark shadow on the left.  In other words, too much contrast for me.  Would be nice if it were a bit softer.  But overall, I really like this pic.</td>', 'I love Bailey''s.... Try Baileys, Kahlua, and vanilla ice cream blended together... just beautiful.  I like this pic, and, for the most part, I like the lighting.  It is a bit harsh, however, on the right which causes a dark shadow on the left.  In other words, too much contrast for me.  Would be nice if it were a bit softer.  But overall, I really like this pic.', '2005-10-03 14:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
