(1757579, 235853, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, makes the image very mysterious and me curious on what this vodka tastes like.  8 from me, only thing I dislike about it is the backround.</td>', 'Nicely lit, makes the image very mysterious and me curious on what this vodka tastes like.  8 from me, only thing I dislike about it is the backround.', '2005-10-04 06:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757583, 237033, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nicely timed and lit but this image is a little bit to "messy" for my taste, what I mean is that I think the splash is too violent for lack of a better word.  Also, there are a lot of distracting details in the image like the reflection in the bottle showing your legs and what looks like a hallway, the drops on the bottle look chaotic as they are too few to make it seem that you had them there on purpoise and that red/brown stuff behind the glass is distracting.  A good effort though and above average in the challenge so it got a 6 from me.</td>', 'Nicely timed and lit but this image is a little bit to "messy" for my taste, what I mean is that I think the splash is too violent for lack of a better word.  Also, there are a lot of distracting details in the image like the reflection in the bottle showing your legs and what looks like a hallway, the drops on the bottle look chaotic as they are too few to make it seem that you had them there on purpoise and that red/brown stuff behind the glass is distracting.  A good effort though and above average in the challenge so it got a 6 from me.', '2005-10-04 06:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757589, 237325, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice touch adding the smoke, otherwise this shot would have been pretty booring.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nice touch adding the smoke, otherwise this shot would have been pretty booring.  7 from me.', '2005-10-04 06:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757591, 235966, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ohh, not really what I wanted to see as I am sitting here at work and it´s freezing outside and pouring down rain...  Seeing this image really makes me want to go somewhere warmer, like to the south coast of france and relax at the beach...  Anyways, I really like the "feel" to this picture and the attention to detail and the lighting is good, I gave this an 8.</td>', 'Ohh, not really what I wanted to see as I am sitting here at work and it´s freezing outside and pouring down rain...  Seeing this image really makes me want to go somewhere warmer, like to the south coast of france and relax at the beach...  Anyways, I really like the "feel" to this picture and the attention to detail and the lighting is good, I gave this an 8.', '2005-10-04 06:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757594, 236978, 27482, '<td valign="top">Just way too dark for my taste, I am a big sucker for texture in an image and here there is hardly none so I coulnd´t give this more than a 4.  Too bad as I like the lighting from the bottom idea and the composition...</td>', 'Just way too dark for my taste, I am a big sucker for texture in an image and here there is hardly none so I coulnd´t give this more than a 4.  Too bad as I like the lighting from the bottom idea and the composition...', '2005-10-04 07:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757601, 236025, 27482, '<td valign="top">A nice fit, that´s for sure.  I gave this a 6 as I think it´s better than most shots in the challenge.  On the downside I dislike that your glass is only half full and that there is no foam at the top, the beer glass would look so much more better if it were full with foam to the brink.  On the plus side I like the grill portion of the shot, especially the flames that have nice texture and aren´t blown out as is easy to do with shots of fire.</td>', 'A nice fit, that´s for sure.  I gave this a 6 as I think it´s better than most shots in the challenge.  On the downside I dislike that your glass is only half full and that there is no foam at the top, the beer glass would look so much more better if it were full with foam to the brink.  On the plus side I like the grill portion of the shot, especially the flames that have nice texture and aren´t blown out as is easy to do with shots of fire.', '2005-10-04 07:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757612, 235724, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks like you went totally overboard with brightening the backround as it looks very noisy and frankly I don´t understand why as the backround is pretty distracting and would have looked much better if it were darker.  I also have to put a question mark about your composition as it´s both tilted downwards to the left and there is IMHO too much space to the right and not enough to the left.  I still gave you a 4 as this is of course on topic but I think you can do much better than this, just put a little bit more effort in the image next time, that´s all...  On the plus side the bottle itself is lit pretty well, normally I dislke glare in the glass but here it adds some interest to the shot.</td>', 'Looks like you went totally overboard with brightening the backround as it looks very noisy and frankly I don´t understand why as the backround is pretty distracting and would have looked much better if it were darker.  I also have to put a question mark about your composition as it´s both tilted downwards to the left and there is IMHO too much space to the right and not enough to the left.  I still gave you a 4 as this is of course on topic but I think you can do much better than this, just put a little bit more effort in the image next time, that´s all...  On the plus side the bottle itself is lit pretty well, normally I dislke glare in the glass but here it adds some interest to the shot.', '2005-10-04 07:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757616, 235356, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, nice timing and the drop totally makes a pretty good but still just average shot to something much better.  I also like that the image is very high key and the lighting is very good and so is the composition, one of the best images in the challenge as far as I am concerned, got a 9 from me.</td>', 'Pretty cool, nice timing and the drop totally makes a pretty good but still just average shot to something much better.  I also like that the image is very high key and the lighting is very good and so is the composition, one of the best images in the challenge as far as I am concerned, got a 9 from me.', '2005-10-04 07:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757625, 235445, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ohhh.. the thumbnail looked so promising...  What I mean is that when I opened this shot there were a number of details that drag this shot down a little bit and all of them could have been avoided with just a little bit of effort on your behalf.  To be specific, the drops on the table (or whatever surface the glass is standing on) just makes this seem sloppy and so do the water drops on the outside of the glass, like you were just lazy and didn´t make the time to clean up after each effort of the splash.<br/> <br/>Anyway, sorry for the rant but I just hate to see such a good image spoiled with what I percieve to be laziness as I could very well have given this image a 9 or even a 10 if the only drops in the image were the ones in the air above the glass.  To be clear though, I still think it´s one of the best in the challenge and I gave it an 8, I really like the splash part, great timing and this is very nicely lit and the backround is very fitting.</td>', 'Ohhh.. the thumbnail looked so promising...  What I mean is that when I opened this shot there were a number of details that drag this shot down a little bit and all of them could have been avoided with just a little bit of effort on your behalf.  To be specific, the drops on the table (or whatever surface the glass is standing on) just makes this seem sloppy and so do the water drops on the outside of the glass, like you were just lazy and didn´t make the time to clean up after each effort of the splash. Anyway, sorry for the rant but I just hate to see such a good image spoiled with what I percieve to be laziness as I could very well have given this image a 9 or even a 10 if the only drops in the image were the ones in the air above the glass.  To be clear though, I still think it´s one of the best in the challenge and I gave it an 8, I really like the splash part, great timing and this is very nicely lit and the backround is very fitting.', '2005-10-04 07:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
