(1757971, 236713, 13759, '<td valign="top">This a very nice picture. Interesting shot. I can´t define the beverage itself, this gives a mistery. May be it was a beer or simply a soda. Great idea. I like the smoke around the glass and hope you put more detais about it in your description.</td>', 'This a very nice picture. Interesting shot. I can´t define the beverage itself, this gives a mistery. May be it was a beer or simply a soda. Great idea. I like the smoke around the glass and hope you put more detais about it in your description.', '2005-10-04 12:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757979, 235706, 13759, '<td valign="top">This an not too bad picture. It is almost interesting. BUt don´t appeal so much to me. I had noticed many dsitractive reflections around the glass. The clouds add so much to the picture, but the trees seems to had much focus then distract a bit. The colour cast formed by all the elements are fine.</td>', 'This an not too bad picture. It is almost interesting. BUt don´t appeal so much to me. I had noticed many dsitractive reflections around the glass. The clouds add so much to the picture, but the trees seems to had much focus then distract a bit. The colour cast formed by all the elements are fine.', '2005-10-04 12:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1757986, 236416, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good shot, why not? Only one question about the strange grey formation over the shadowed glass. It´s like a watermark an not much pleasant. All the way, a nice idea.</td>', 'Good shot, why not? Only one question about the strange grey formation over the shadowed glass. It´s like a watermark an not much pleasant. All the way, a nice idea.', '2005-10-04 12:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
