(1758052, 236416, 43156, '<td valign="top">Rated 7 after second look</td>', 'Rated 7 after second look', '2005-10-04 13:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758056, 237273, 43115, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot... and I think I know how you did it... :)<br/> <br/>Technically well done, composition is spot on, focus, depth of field, tone and color are all good.  Technically a very well done photo.<br/> <br/>But... There are a lot of distractions in this photo.  Bubbles where they don''t belong, ripples, splashes, all things that take away from the main point of the image.  Understandably hard to avoid, but essential to correct in order for this to be a really remarkable picture.  A good overall effort though.</td>', 'An interesting shot... and I think I know how you did it... :) Technically well done, composition is spot on, focus, depth of field, tone and color are all good.  Technically a very well done photo. But... There are a lot of distractions in this photo.  Bubbles where they don''t belong, ripples, splashes, all things that take away from the main point of the image.  Understandably hard to avoid, but essential to correct in order for this to be a really remarkable picture.  A good overall effort though.', '2005-10-04 13:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758061, 235815, 43115, '<td valign="top">Not very exicting, this shot...<br/> <br/>The contrast between the edge of the glass and the black background is so strong that the camera couldn''t reproduce it well, leading to the jagged edge along the left side.  Not so good.  You did do a good job with focus and sharpness, and I imagine exposure was tricky for this as well.  The subject is very well lit.<br/> <br/>An interesting macro study, but just not very "Wow!".  Sorry.</td>', 'Not very exicting, this shot... The contrast between the edge of the glass and the black background is so strong that the camera couldn''t reproduce it well, leading to the jagged edge along the left side.  Not so good.  You did do a good job with focus and sharpness, and I imagine exposure was tricky for this as well.  The subject is very well lit. An interesting macro study, but just not very "Wow!".  Sorry.', '2005-10-04 13:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758064, 235973, 43571, '<td valign="top">real chaos, nice colors</td>', 'real chaos, nice colors', '2005-10-04 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758125, 236029, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great job on this photo. This was one of my favorites in this challenge. I gave it a ten.</td>', 'Great job on this photo. This was one of my favorites in this challenge. I gave it a ten.', '2005-10-04 13:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758129, 237273, 17291, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. How did you do it? The color you selected really adds to the photo. I gave it a ten.</td>', 'I love this photo. How did you do it? The color you selected really adds to the photo. I gave it a ten.', '2005-10-04 13:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1758180, 235058, 27207, '<td valign="top">The pic is a bit uncomfortable to look at.....there is too much clutter in  it ...and the main things the mugs i think shoud have been more prominent..presently the eye is drawn towards the knives</td>', 'The pic is a bit uncomfortable to look at.....there is too much clutter in  it ...and the main things the mugs i think shoud have been more prominent..presently the eye is drawn towards the knives', '2005-10-04 13:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
