(1759047, 237014, 42984, '<td valign="top">Very good backlighting whilst still getting the face with a soft light. The glass is a little naff.</td>', 'Very good backlighting whilst still getting the face with a soft light. The glass is a little naff.', '2005-10-04 21:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1759048, 237331, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo, nice stop action with the lid.</td>', 'Very cool photo, nice stop action with the lid.', '2005-10-04 21:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1759050, 235287, 42984, '<td valign="top">when you do deliberately out of focus shots like this, you need to give your point of focus a reason for being there.  The composition how you have it doesn''t convey a story and so it is hard to get emotional about it. It does need rotating too so the the verticals are vertical</td>', 'when you do deliberately out of focus shots like this, you need to give your point of focus a reason for being there.  The composition how you have it doesn''t convey a story and so it is hard to get emotional about it. It does need rotating too so the the verticals are vertical', '2005-10-04 21:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
