(1760282, 237210, 43936, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that clever and talented people don''t have much of a chance in these competitions... other''s lack of culture, vision, understanding and basic artistic education makes it hard to be appreciated as deserved. This is a very good and original shoot, and because of the ignorance reigning here (e.g. commentaries such as the ones below... well, some of them) your rating is very low. I am really sorry and this is true also for other beatiful shots who scored very low: see Old and New, Milk delivery etc. Instead, I noticed trivial and ordinary stuff rated very high... COngrats anyway and keep it that way!</td>', 'It seems to me that clever and talented people don''t have much of a chance in these competitions... other''s lack of culture, vision, understanding and basic artistic education makes it hard to be appreciated as deserved. This is a very good and original shoot, and because of the ignorance reigning here (e.g. commentaries such as the ones below... well, some of them) your rating is very low. I am really sorry and this is true also for other beatiful shots who scored very low: see Old and New, Milk delivery etc. Instead, I noticed trivial and ordinary stuff rated very high... COngrats anyway and keep it that way!', '2005-10-05 05:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
