(1760948, 235684, 35804, '<td valign="top">180? waaayyyyyyyyyy underrated IMO...one of my favorite images of the challenge.</td>', '180? waaayyyyyyyyyy underrated IMO...one of my favorite images of the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:43:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1760950, 237325, 40580, '<td valign="top">OMG, I was only kidding about the Joey comment.  I gave it low marks because of the fogging.  I guess I was in the minority.</td>', 'OMG, I was only kidding about the Joey comment.  I gave it low marks because of the fogging.  I guess I was in the minority.', '2005-10-05 10:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1760957, 237273, 40580, '<td valign="top">Ok, how did you do it?</td>', 'Ok, how did you do it?', '2005-10-05 10:46:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761041, 235480, 35357, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 20, great job.  Remote between your teeth, funny!  I like the sexual undertones, I think this would be a great advert shot.</td>', 'Congrats on the top 20, great job.  Remote between your teeth, funny!  I like the sexual undertones, I think this would be a great advert shot.', '2005-10-05 11:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761083, 237273, 15242, '<td valign="top">You got it!  Great job!</td>', 'You got it!  Great job!', '2005-10-05 11:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761122, 235731, 39308, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and congrats on the blue ribbon. I was wondering how you did that! :)</td>', 'Great shot, and congrats on the blue ribbon. I was wondering how you did that! :)', '2005-10-05 11:59:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761125, 236920, 39308, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your red ribbon! Great job!</td>', 'Congrats on your red ribbon! Great job!', '2005-10-05 12:01:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761127, 237273, 39308, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your yellow ribbon! Well done!</td>', 'Congrats on your yellow ribbon! Well done!', '2005-10-05 12:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761131, 237273, 39270, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  Sweet image... hopefully when you get back you can give us a "How to"!<br/> <br/>Great Job!</td>', 'Congrats!  Sweet image... hopefully when you get back you can give us a "How to"! Great Job!', '2005-10-05 12:07:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761236, 235252, 43256, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rikki11:</b></div><hr/><i> LOL! Red wine isn''t carbonated :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually there was no carbonation in this.  This was red wine and I added a few drops of red food coloring to get a better color.  For some reason air bubble formed up against the glass.</td>', 'Originally posted by rikki11: LOL! Red wine isn''t carbonated :)   Actually there was no carbonation in this.  This was red wine and I added a few drops of red food coloring to get a better color.  For some reason air bubble formed up against the glass.', '2005-10-05 12:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761250, 235517, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice "study"...it reeks character..just a pity you got that bit of overexposure in the eye/forehead area because I`m sure it would have finished much higher had you been able to avoid that.<br/> <br/>Even with the overexposure, I think your score should have been higher.<br/>You managed to capture a natural unposed look and that isn`t always easy.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a very nice "study"...it reeks character..just a pity you got that bit of overexposure in the eye/forehead area because I`m sure it would have finished much higher had you been able to avoid that. Even with the overexposure, I think your score should have been higher.You managed to capture a natural unposed look and that isn`t always easy. ', '2005-10-05 12:40:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761323, 235860, 10732, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by zara-opal:</b></div><hr/><i> boring </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I can appreciate that you didn''t like the photo, but do you really think that this was a helpful post?  I think that if you don''t have anything positive to say, why say it?  Just my opinion, but I thought we were in this to help each out to become better photographers, not just knock each other down.  I am sure you are a great photographer with lots to offer, so why not be positive?</td>', 'Originally posted by zara-opal: boring   I can appreciate that you didn''t like the photo, but do you really think that this was a helpful post?  I think that if you don''t have anything positive to say, why say it?  Just my opinion, but I thought we were in this to help each out to become better photographers, not just knock each other down.  I am sure you are a great photographer with lots to offer, so why not be positive?', '2005-10-05 12:56:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761500, 235517, 20462, '<td valign="top">i think this image is just fine and represents a beverage and the act of consuming it.</td>', 'i think this image is just fine and represents a beverage and the act of consuming it.', '2005-10-05 13:37:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761706, 236441, 42504, '<td valign="top">This was one of the few that got a 10 from me.  I like the textured background.  I thought it added to the photo. I think it looks like a Hallmark card also.  good job.</td>', 'This was one of the few that got a 10 from me.  I like the textured background.  I thought it added to the photo. I think it looks like a Hallmark card also.  good job.', '2005-10-05 14:32:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761728, 237281, 42504, '<td valign="top">I loved this photo!! I am a nature person.  I like the calfs tongue sticking out  with traces of milk on it.  This earned a 10 from me and I didn''t give very many!!!   I kind of like the twig in front of the udder. Good photo for the Drink Milk commercial.</td>', 'I loved this photo!! I am a nature person.  I like the calfs tongue sticking out  with traces of milk on it.  This earned a 10 from me and I didn''t give very many!!!   I kind of like the twig in front of the udder. Good photo for the Drink Milk commercial.', '2005-10-05 14:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761750, 235706, 42504, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites.  I gave it a 10.  I like the sky clouds and the trees. I  like different objects in photos if they are in the background.  I think the trees frame the drink!</td>', 'This was one of my favorites.  I gave it a 10.  I like the sky clouds and the trees. I  like different objects in photos if they are in the background.  I think the trees frame the drink!', '2005-10-05 14:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761770, 236603, 42504, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I gave it a 10. I like how Marthas nose is crinkled while begging for a drink!!!      lol</td>', 'I like it.  I gave it a 10. I like how Marthas nose is crinkled while begging for a drink!!!      lol', '2005-10-05 14:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761781, 236751, 42504, '<td valign="top">I liked it!  It got a 10 from me.  I like nostalgia photos!</td>', 'I liked it!  It got a 10 from me.  I like nostalgia photos!', '2005-10-05 14:49:40.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1761981, 237325, 8377, '<td valign="top">when i see coke and fog, i think joey. shoot, you''ve been doing really great lately!!! no surprise though. keep it up and congrats on another high finish.</td>', 'when i see coke and fog, i think joey. shoot, you''ve been doing really great lately!!! no surprise though. keep it up and congrats on another high finish.', '2005-10-05 15:31:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762066, 237273, 37893, '<td valign="top">You got a ribbon! Slippy''s prediction came true :) Congrats!</td>', 'You got a ribbon! Slippy''s prediction came true :) Congrats!', '2005-10-05 15:52:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762109, 237273, 5515, '<td valign="top">Congrats. A brilliant image...</td>', 'Congrats. A brilliant image...', '2005-10-05 16:01:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762167, 235445, 5515, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Congrats on the results... A lighting suggestion. Try bouncing the flash off the background to create a backlight situation. Then you can fire some flash right into the face without any super harsh reflections. This will also allow edges to become more prounounce and detail to pop. Backlighting glass is a blast... Great work...</td>', 'Nice image. Congrats on the results... A lighting suggestion. Try bouncing the flash off the background to create a backlight situation. Then you can fire some flash right into the face without any super harsh reflections. This will also allow edges to become more prounounce and detail to pop. Backlighting glass is a blast... Great work...', '2005-10-05 16:20:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762266, 235731, 14212, '<td valign="top">It deserves to be an outcast.  lol.   contrats on 1st.</td>', 'It deserves to be an outcast.  lol.   contrats on 1st.', '2005-10-05 16:54:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762278, 235935, 561, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments. I think I should give you some explanation of my photo.<br/>This is a glass of Cola lit by strong, direct sunlight, put on a sheet of white paper and photographed from above. Then I cut off the part with the glass to obtain the impression that what you can see is the glass itself. As simple as that. :)<br/>I suppose it was too vague and now, after some time since my submission, I do not like the photo as much as before.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 15:58:46.</i></td>', 'Thank you for all the comments. I think I should give you some explanation of my photo.This is a glass of Cola lit by strong, direct sunlight, put on a sheet of white paper and photographed from above. Then I cut off the part with the glass to obtain the impression that what you can see is the glass itself. As simple as that. :)I suppose it was too vague and now, after some time since my submission, I do not like the photo as much as before.', '2005-10-05 16:56:35.000000', '2005-10-05 16:58:46.000000', 0),
(1762321, 237273, 39349, '<td valign="top">You totally rock girl! YEAH!</td>', 'You totally rock girl! YEAH!', '2005-10-05 17:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762324, 235731, 42800, '<td valign="top">very nice work nad a gr8 idea</td>', 'very nice work nad a gr8 idea', '2005-10-05 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762405, 237273, 24976, '<td valign="top">congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'congrats on the ribbon!', '2005-10-05 17:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762422, 236934, 30881, '<td valign="top">Thought this would end up in at least a top 5 if not ribbon winner. This really is a great shot, so don''t get discouraged.</td>', 'Thought this would end up in at least a top 5 if not ribbon winner. This really is a great shot, so don''t get discouraged.', '2005-10-05 17:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762549, 237146, 40594, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the good comments.  And Antanas, here in Iceland you only find unspoiled creeks and they are ususaly not that long. You always know what is going on upstream - there is nobody and nothing there.</td>', 'Thanks for all the good comments.  And Antanas, here in Iceland you only find unspoiled creeks and they are ususaly not that long. You always know what is going on upstream - there is nobody and nothing there.', '2005-10-05 18:13:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762703, 236796, 22288, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments. I am having such a good time with the challenges when I actually have time to do them. I especially enjoy when the comments have very constructive critique. Thanks again to all, I am very excited to have made it into the top 30. On to the next goal...Top 20</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments. I am having such a good time with the challenges when I actually have time to do them. I especially enjoy when the comments have very constructive critique. Thanks again to all, I am very excited to have made it into the top 30. On to the next goal...Top 20', '2005-10-05 19:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762705, 237406, 16739, '<td valign="top">good shot , hurts the average</td>', 'good shot , hurts the average', '2005-10-05 19:49:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762706, 237325, 37779, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, beat ya ;)</td>', 'Hehehe, beat ya ;)', '2005-10-05 19:49:43.000000', NULL, 0),
