(1763104, 237024, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very abstract like. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'Very abstract like. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.', '2005-10-05 22:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1763106, 236876, 22734, '<td valign="top">Burn, burn, burn. very nicely done. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'Burn, burn, burn. very nicely done. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.', '2005-10-05 22:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1763108, 236786, 22734, '<td valign="top">Interesting visual. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'Interesting visual. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.', '2005-10-05 22:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1763113, 235356, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 10 finish with this Harp gem!</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 10 finish with this Harp gem!', '2005-10-05 22:26:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1763120, 235853, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very professionally done. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'Very professionally done. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.', '2005-10-05 22:27:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1763232, 235731, 42567, '<td valign="top">Great job..!!</td>', 'Great job..!!', '2005-10-05 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1763733, 237083, 28710, '<td valign="top">Alternate versions of this pic are:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=240657" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/240657.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/240657.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/240657.jpg"/></a><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=240656" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/240656.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/240656.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/240656.jpg"/></a><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=240658" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/240658.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/240658.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/240658.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Please feel free to comment on the alternate versions as well.<br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Alternate versions of this pic are:  Please feel free to comment on the alternate versions as well. Thanks!', '2005-10-06 01:54:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1764052, 235030, 42202, '<td valign="top">okay then........</td>', 'okay then........', '2005-10-06 04:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1764075, 237325, 36628, '<td valign="top">Muaha I knew it! Again, cool shot and congrats on 4th.</td>', 'Muaha I knew it! Again, cool shot and congrats on 4th.', '2005-10-06 05:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1764362, 236541, 17203, '<td valign="top">Whoa... this was WAYYYY underrated. I had it pegged for the top 10. A little midtone levels and saturation adjustment to brighten the image might have helped, but the concept is great.</td>', 'Whoa... this was WAYYYY underrated. I had it pegged for the top 10. A little midtone levels and saturation adjustment to brighten the image might have helped, but the concept is great.', '2005-10-06 10:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1764568, 237273, 16230, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon Katherine! Very well done!</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon Katherine! Very well done!', '2005-10-06 12:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1764927, 235731, 43360, '<td valign="top">you first, me last :)</td>', 'you first, me last :)', '2005-10-06 14:34:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765281, 236920, 40371, '<td valign="top">I am very happy for you, especially after reading your comments.  It was definitely worth the effort I''m sure :)</td>', 'I am very happy for you, especially after reading your comments.  It was definitely worth the effort I''m sure :)', '2005-10-06 16:41:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765319, 235853, 40371, '<td valign="top">Didn''t realize this was a lava lamp.  I gave you a 10 on this (one of only 3 in this challenge).  I really like your color scheme and the lighting.  I didn''t think the bottle looked blown-out, thought it looked almost un-earthly.  Plus I think your border looks great and doesn''t detract from the pic at all.  Congrats on your top 10 and double congrats for 2 top 10''s in a row.</td>', 'Didn''t realize this was a lava lamp.  I gave you a 10 on this (one of only 3 in this challenge).  I really like your color scheme and the lighting.  I didn''t think the bottle looked blown-out, thought it looked almost un-earthly.  Plus I think your border looks great and doesn''t detract from the pic at all.  Congrats on your top 10 and double congrats for 2 top 10''s in a row.', '2005-10-06 16:55:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765358, 237248, 40371, '<td valign="top">I really thought this would place higher but congrats anyway on your top 20 finish.  Glad to hear you drank the good stuff and massacred the bad :)</td>', 'I really thought this would place higher but congrats anyway on your top 20 finish.  Glad to hear you drank the good stuff and massacred the bad :)', '2005-10-06 17:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765398, 235083, 40371, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a 9, really thought it would place higher.  Nice job, bubbles are really crisp.</td>', 'I gave this one a 9, really thought it would place higher.  Nice job, bubbles are really crisp.', '2005-10-06 17:16:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765436, 237337, 40371, '<td valign="top">I agree w/ roadrunner, way too many low votes.  Apparently people don''t understand how difficult it is to take a shot like this.  As for the lack of color, I think it adds, not detracts, from the pic.  Nice job, you definitely should have placed higher.</td>', 'I agree w/ roadrunner, way too many low votes.  Apparently people don''t understand how difficult it is to take a shot like this.  As for the lack of color, I think it adds, not detracts, from the pic.  Nice job, you definitely should have placed higher.', '2005-10-06 17:25:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765452, 235705, 40371, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9, surprised at all the 5''s and 6''s.  Your pic almost has a nostalgic look to it.  It''s timeless.  Nice job.</td>', 'I gave this a 9, surprised at all the 5''s and 6''s.  Your pic almost has a nostalgic look to it.  It''s timeless.  Nice job.', '2005-10-06 17:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765487, 237134, 40371, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on your first submission!</td>', 'Excellent job on your first submission!', '2005-10-06 17:36:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765499, 237033, 40371, '<td valign="top">Other than the reflections in the bottle I really liked this shot.  You had me totally fooled-I had no idea you just threw this together last minute :)</td>', 'Other than the reflections in the bottle I really liked this shot.  You had me totally fooled-I had no idea you just threw this together last minute :)', '2005-10-06 17:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765513, 235389, 40371, '<td valign="top">I really like the white background and the reflective "hot spots" add to the effect.  The border is an excellent pick.  You are an 8 in my book and I really think you should have placed higher.</td>', 'I really like the white background and the reflective "hot spots" add to the effect.  The border is an excellent pick.  You are an 8 in my book and I really think you should have placed higher.', '2005-10-06 17:43:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765534, 237075, 40371, '<td valign="top">I loved the etching on your glass, it''s what made the pic stand out for me-gave it a real sense of originality in a sea of martinis and cosmos.  The colors really compliment each other as well.  I really thought you would place higher.</td>', 'I loved the etching on your glass, it''s what made the pic stand out for me-gave it a real sense of originality in a sea of martinis and cosmos.  The colors really compliment each other as well.  I really thought you would place higher.', '2005-10-06 17:49:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765547, 235230, 40371, '<td valign="top">Your pic was one of only three 10''s I handed out this challenge.  I can''t believe it didn''t place higher than this.  The texture is outstanding and though its a little dark I think the shadows add a real sense of dimension, almost a lonely or really serene feeling.</td>', 'Your pic was one of only three 10''s I handed out this challenge.  I can''t believe it didn''t place higher than this.  The texture is outstanding and though its a little dark I think the shadows add a real sense of dimension, almost a lonely or really serene feeling.', '2005-10-06 17:53:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1765566, 236487, 40371, '<td valign="top">Thought you would have placed higher.  I guess there aren''t many people out there who have experimented w/ lighting alcoholic beverages on fire-I however have. I am very impressed with the classy composition, the dark background causes you to really focus on the subject.  Nice job.</td>', 'Thought you would have placed higher.  I guess there aren''t many people out there who have experimented w/ lighting alcoholic beverages on fire-I however have. I am very impressed with the classy composition, the dark background causes you to really focus on the subject.  Nice job.', '2005-10-06 18:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
