(2355871, 237348, 27845, '<td valign="top">The framing and the POC view of this image are well chosen. You might have included all of the orange glass though, or cropped out some more. This creates a ''chopped off'' impression. Also, your background is too busy because the text on the bottles is still readable. You would either have needed a far narrower DOF, or bottles with less prominent labels.</td>', 'The framing and the POC view of this image are well chosen. You might have included all of the orange glass though, or cropped out some more. This creates a ''chopped off'' impression. Also, your background is too busy because the text on the bottles is still readable. You would either have needed a far narrower DOF, or bottles with less prominent labels.', '2006-04-29 06:05:33.000000', NULL, 0),
